---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro'
import OutsideScene from '../scenes/outside/OutsideScene'
// Copy: content/copy/home.md
---
<Page title="Deck — Scale product velocity with self-directing AI teams." description="Choose what to build. Let your AI teams get to work." current="/">
  <section class="hero wrap">
    <p class="status">Deck is running your AI teams</p>
    <h1>Scale product velocity with self-directing AI teams.</h1>
    <p class="lede">Choose what to build. Let your AI teams get to work.</p>
    <div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="/how-it-works/">See how it works</a></div>
  </section>

  <div class="wide">
    <figure class="plate hero-plate">
      <div class="plate-head">
        <span>The factory from outside</span>
        <span class="key" aria-hidden="true">
          <span><i style="background:var(--human)"></i>You and your AI assistants</span>
          <span><i style="background:var(--ai)"></i>AI teams</span>
          <span><i style="background:#33434B"></i>GitHub and Deck</span>
        </span>
      </div>
      <OutsideScene client:load label="Ready features flow from GitHub into Deck and its AI teams. Finished work returns to GitHub. You and your AI assistants supervise from outside the factory." />
    </figure>
  </div>

  <section class="block wrap" aria-labelledby="yours-h">
    <h2 id="yours-h">What stays yours</h2>
    <ol class="ledger">
      <li><span class="n">01</span><p>You, the Director, choose the features and who builds them.</p></li>
      <li><span class="n">02</span><p>You supervise the factory with your AI assistants.</p></li>
      <li><span class="n">03</span><p>You decide whether the results meet your goals.</p></li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="block wrap closing">
    <p class="lede">Ready to watch your features become finished products? See how it works.</p>
    <div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="/how-it-works/">See how it works</a></div>
  </section>
</Page>

<style>
  .hero { text-align: center; padding-top: 88px; padding-bottom: 48px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center }
  .hero h1 { max-width: 18ch; margin-top: 22px }
  .hero .lede { margin: 0 auto 26px }
  /* The drawing gets more width than the text, so its labels stay readable. */
  .wide { max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px }
  .hero-plate { margin: 0 }
  .hero-plate :global(.scene) { padding: 8px 12px 16px }
  .ledger { list-style: none; margin: 28px 0 0; padding: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule) }
  .ledger li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 72px 1fr; align-items: baseline; padding: 26px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule) }
  .ledger .n { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 22px; color: var(--human-text) }
  .ledger p { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: clamp(22px, 2.4vw, 30px); line-height: 1.3; color: var(--graphite); margin: 0; max-width: 34ch }
  .closing { text-align: center; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center }
  .closing .lede { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: clamp(26px, 3vw, 36px); line-height: 1.2; color: var(--graphite); max-width: 26ch }
</style>
